        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Henry Grace; Dwight D. Eisenhower\n- Roles: art director; politician; Army general; President of the United States\n- Awards: Academy Award; Best Art Direction\n- Places: United States\n\nFacts:\n- Dwight D. Eisenhower was born on October 14, 1890.\n- Henry Grace won an Academy Award and received twelve additional nominations in the Best Art Direction category.\n- Dwight D. Eisenhower was an American politician and Army general.\n- Dwight D. Eisenhower served as the 34th President of the United States from 1953 to 1961.\n- Dwight D. Eisenhower died on March 28, 1969.",
